# =============================================================
# Godot-generated / local-only — regenerated automatically, so
# there's nothing worth tracking history for and they just bloat
# the repo with noise.
# =============================================================

# Godot 4's local editor cache (thumbnails, shader cache, etc.)
.godot/

# Per-file import metadata + the imported/converted copies Godot
# generates next to source assets (textures, audio, models...).
# These get rebuilt automatically the moment the editor reopens the
# project, so committing them just creates merge-conflict noise.
*.import
.import/

# Editor/OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp

# Exported game builds — these are build OUTPUT, not source. They're
# often large (tens/hundreds of MB) and get regenerated from an
# Export Preset any time you need them, so they don't belong in
# version history. Comment out (put a # in front) if you specifically
# want a build itself backed up.
# (export_presets.cfg itself is small config, not a build — kept tracked.)
BUILDS/
Exports/

# Mono/C# build artifacts (harmless to ignore even if this project
# is pure GDScript with no C#).
.mono/
data_*/
mono_crash.*.json
